 The line reader ends at LF instead, and answers a zero-length text at end of
 input rather than a null, because `read-line`'s Maybe is decided by the
 caller on the length rather than on a sentinel pointer.

  emit-hosted-read-line-helper : CodegenState -> CodegenState
  emit-hosted-read-line-helper (st) =
