  grounds Device.Port, Device.Block
  cites Codex chapter Phase Allocator (phase-start, phase-measure, phase-took, phase-compact, phase-compact-poison, PhaseStart, PhaseMetrics, deck-short-of)
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe
  cites Foreword chapter Wrap64
  cites Foreword chapter Fat16
  cites Foreword chapter ImportGate
  cites Foreword chapter FactDisk

  cites Emit chapter Codex Emitter (codex-emit-text-chapter, codex-emit-type-defs, codex-emit-def, codex-emit-grounds-line)
  cites Emit chapter IR Text Emitter (emit-ir-chapter, emit-ir-chapter-prefix, ir-defs-wire-size, ir-print-defs, ir-trace-def-sizes, ir-trace-dce-cost, ir-prune-unreachable, ir-prune-unreachable-roots, ir-dropped-budgeted-punctuals)
